<Base
  title="Detox & Residential Programs in Orange County"
  description="Medically supervised detox, residential treatment, and a family program in Santa Ana. In-network with Anthem, Blue Shield, United, Aetna, Cigna, Humana, and TRICARE."
  path="/programs/"
  keywords="detox program Orange County, residential treatment Santa Ana, family program rehab California"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Programs</p>
      <p class="kicker">Programs</p>
      <h1>Levels of care on one campus</h1>
      <p class="lede">The right starting point depends on what’s happening medically, what’s been used, and what support exists at home. We decide that with a clinical assessment — not a website quiz.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid-3">
      <article class="card">
        <h2><a href="/programs/detox/">Detox</a></h2>
        <p>Medically supervised withdrawal management. The first days under clinical supervision, around the clock.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2><a href="/programs/residential/">Residential</a></h2>
        <p>Live on campus while doing the clinical work — therapy, group, family sessions, and skills practice in a structured environment.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2><a href="/programs/family/">Family program</a></h2>
        <p>Education and therapy for partners, parents, and adult children while a loved one is in treatment.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>How we decide where to start</h2>
      <p>The first call covers substances used, frequency, last use, prior withdrawals, current medications, mental health history, and living situation. That conversation, plus a medical assessment on arrival, drives the recommendation.</p>
      <h2>Insurance and cost</h2>
      <p>We are in-network with Anthem, Blue Shield of California, UnitedHealthcare, Aetna, Cigna, Humana, and TRICARE. Benefits are verified before admission. Call (866) 514-7282 to start.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</Base>
